    skos:editorialNote "Curated classification (group=grp_woven_fabrics_apparel): Textile manufactures (jute, silk broad stuffs, hair cloth, felt, dry goods, sails) belong with Woven Textiles, not paper/glass/sundries. Layer-1 observations: 27 rows, 1889–1897. Series: CSP_Canadian Trade and Navigation ×2; CSP_Canadian_Exports_BlankSeries (inferred, series not printed) ×25. Units: (no unit) ×27. Top routes: Quebec → All Countries ×5; Canada → United States ×4; Canada → Newfoundland ×4; Canada → All Countries ×4."@en ;
